@startuml k9-chat-class-diagram

top to bottom direction

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #666666
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E8E8F0
  FontColor #1a1a2e
  FontSize 11
  AttributeFontSize 10
  AttributeFontColor #333333
  StereotypeFontSize 10
  StereotypeFontColor #555555
}

skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5FA
  BorderColor #9090C0
  FontColor #1a1a2e
  FontSize 12
  FontStyle bold
}

title K9Chat — ABB / SBB Class Structure\n<size:10>ChatAgent composes GuardAgent directly (no Squad/Orchestrator layer in this example)</size>

' ══════════════════════════════════════════
' K9-AIF ABB LAYER
' ══════════════════════════════════════════
package "K9-AIF ABB Layer" <<Frame>> {

  abstract class BaseAgent {
    + execute(payload: dict): dict
    # apply_pre_governance(payload)
    # apply_post_governance(result)
  }

  abstract class BaseModelRouter {
    + invoke(request: InferenceRequest): InferenceResponse
  }

  class K9ModelRouter {
    + invoke(request: InferenceRequest): InferenceResponse
  }

  class DefaultModelRouter {
    + invoke(request: InferenceRequest): InferenceResponse
  }

  class ModelRouterFactory {
    + {static} get_router(config: dict): BaseModelRouter
    + {static} reset(): None
  }

  class LLMFactory {
    + {static} is_bootstrapped(): bool
    + {static} bootstrap(config): None
  }

  class LlmInvoke <<utility>> {
    + llm_invoke(config, request): InferenceResponse
    + llm_invoke_stream(config, request): Iterator[str]
  }

  class InferenceRequest {
    + prompt: str
    + system_prompt: str
    + task_type: str
    + metadata: dict
  }

  abstract class BasePromptEvaluator {
    + evaluate(prompt, input_data, actual_output, expected): EvaluationResult
    + compare(prompt_a, prompt_b, test_cases): ComparisonResult
    + run_suite(prompt, test_cases): SuiteResult
  }

  class EvaluationFactory {
    + {static} create(config: dict): BasePromptEvaluator
  }
}

' ══════════════════════════════════════════
' K9CHAT SBB
' ══════════════════════════════════════════
package "K9Chat SBB" <<Frame>> {

  class ChatAgent {
    - guard_agent: GuardAgent
    + __init__(config=None)
    + execute(payload: dict): dict
    + execute_stream(payload: dict): Iterator[str]
    + truncate_history(session_id, keep_count): None
    - _format_prompt(message, history, unhinged_level,\n    profanity_level, length_level): str
  }

  class GuardAgent {
    - enabled: bool
    - fail_closed: bool
    + execute(payload: dict): dict
  }

  class K9PromptEvaluator {
    + evaluate(...): EvaluationResult
  }

  class QueueSlot {
    + position: int
    + __enter__(): QueueSlot
    + __exit__(*exc): bool
    + waited_seconds(): float
  }

  class ProjectManager {
    + create_project(owner_id, ...): Project
    + list_projects(owner_id): list
    + get_project_for_owner(project_id, owner_id): Project
  }

  class KnowledgeRetriever {
    + retrieve(query: str, top_k: int): list
  }
}

' ══════════════════════════════════════════
' INHERITANCE — ABB → SBB
' ══════════════════════════════════════════
BaseAgent <|-- ChatAgent
BaseAgent <|-- GuardAgent
BaseModelRouter <|-- K9ModelRouter
BaseModelRouter <|-- DefaultModelRouter
BasePromptEvaluator <|-- K9PromptEvaluator

' ══════════════════════════════════════════
' COMPOSITION & DEPENDENCIES
' ══════════════════════════════════════════
ChatAgent         "1" --> "1"  GuardAgent          : checks input via
ChatAgent         "1" --> "1"  LlmInvoke            : invokes chat reply via
LlmInvoke         "1" --> "1"  ModelRouterFactory   : resolves router via
ModelRouterFactory "1" --> "1" BaseModelRouter      : resolves
ModelRouterFactory "1" ..> "1" LLMFactory           : bootstraps if needed
ChatAgent         "1" --> "1"  InferenceRequest     : creates
BaseModelRouter    "1" --> "1" InferenceRequest     : uses
EvaluationFactory  "1" --> "1" BasePromptEvaluator  : creates
K9PromptEvaluator  "1" ..> "1" InferenceRequest     : judges reply via
ChatAgent          "1" --> "1" KnowledgeRetriever   : grounds reply via
ChatAgent          "1" --> "1" ProjectManager       : scopes Projects via

note bottom of ChatAgent
FastAPI's app.py wraps every /chat
call in a QueueSlot (concurrency +
GPU-thermal admission guard) before
ChatAgent.execute()/execute_stream()
ever runs. Not a class dependency of
ChatAgent itself -- enforced by the
caller, same pattern as Zero Trust
being enforced by an Orchestrator
rather than the Agent it wraps.
end note

note bottom of GuardAgent
Composed directly inside ChatAgent,
not dispatched through a Squad --
chat_squad.py/squad.yaml exist in
this directory but are dead code,
superseded when the Settings-panel
config-override feature needed
ChatAgent built directly (see
chat.py's build_chat_agent()).
end note

note bottom of LlmInvoke
Both execute() (llm_invoke) and
execute_stream() (llm_invoke_stream)
go through this wrapper, never
ModelRouterFactory directly --
adds retry-on-empty-response (a
hybrid-reasoning model burning its
token budget on invisible "thinking"
and returning 0 chars is a real,
observed failure mode) and emits the
LLMCall trace event. execute() used
to call router.invoke() directly,
skipping both -- fixed 2026-09-21.
end note

@enduml
